[1m[38;5;231mWhere should the user ID come from?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m Return it from login (Recommended)
     [38;5;246mKeep login(username, password); add userId to the returned object as the server would. No call-site changes.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Optional third parameter
     [38;5;246mlogin(username, password, userId = null). Signature widens now; the existing caller passes nothing yet.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Required param + form field
